# Android Native

`android/` is version-controlled. Change only when necessary (permissions, deps, icons/splash).

## Common touch points

- `AndroidManifest.xml` — permissions, deep link `alansar://`, metadata
- `app/build.gradle` — signing, deps, RN config
- `gradle.properties` — JVM args, new arch, Hermes
- Signing: use `keystore.properties.template`; never commit `*.keystore`, `keystore.properties`, `pc-api-key.json`

## Builds

```bash
npm run clean                 # not ./gradlew clean alone
npm run build:debug
cd android && ./gradlew assembleDebug
# EAS production AAB
eas build --platform android --profile production
```

After native module mismatches: `npm run clean && npm install && npm start`.

Ensure EAS Build compatibility when changing native config. Test thoroughly before merge.
